{"ref":"BDB, אַ֫יִל³","hw":"אַ֫יִל³","html":"† III. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אַ֫יִל</span> ?]</big>  <strong>n.m. leader, chief (</strong>= ram, as leader of flock? cf. Di <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a> Ol<sup>§ 142 f</sup> Lag<sup>BN 170</sup> & v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.17\">Ez 34:17</a><strong>)</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.11\">Ez 31:11</a>; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.13\">Ez 17:13</a>; + <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.15\">2 K 24:15</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">אולי</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אוּל²\" href=\"/BDB,_אוּל²\", dir=\"rtl\">אוּל</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.21\">Ez 32:21</a> (del. Co, v. 𝔊).—<em>leader, chief</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מוֹאָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.13\">Ez 17:13</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.15\">2 K 24:15</a> Qr; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ גּוֹיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.11\">Ez 31:11</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:17\" href=\"/Job.41.17\">Jb 41:17</a> v. sub i. -<a data-ref=\"BDB, אלה\" href=\"/BDB,_אלה\", dir=\"rtl\">אלה</a>; perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">Ez 31:14</a> but cf. infr. iv. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַ֫יִל⁴\" href=\"/BDB,_אַ֫יִל⁴\", dir=\"rtl\">איל</a> & also <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> Note 1).","next":"BDB, אַ֫יִל⁴","prev":"BDB, אַ֫יִל²"}